  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "Mixed-use: also up to 3 million sq ft office/R&D and up to 100,000 sq ft retail per city items. Product type is a working label from \"multi-family residential units\".",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001500"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City staff report (Nov. 19, 2024): up to 1.8 million sq ft of residential, 3 million sq ft office/R&D (2.2 million under Option B), about 100,000 sq ft retail and 10,000 sq ft childcare; housing in Area D under Option A and also Area C under Option B. Development agreement: 10-year term with up to three 5-year extensions; at least 1.5 acres of parkland, plus 1.5 acres in Area C under Option B; 1 parking space per unit in Areas C and D. Site is currently used for Levi's Stadium event parking (3,300 spaces); a prior owner demolished buildings for a planned Yahoo! campus.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001993"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "San Jose Spotlight: Council approved unanimously on Nov. 19, 2024; Kylli has owned the property since 2017; tallest building limited to 192 feet; more than seven acres of parks; construction to be phased starting with housing.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001994"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY, Nov. 2024: four podium structures; construction expected in four phases over at least a decade.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001996"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQAnet SCH 2018072068: NOPs July 27 and Oct. 1, 2018 (3005 Democracy Way Mixed-Use) and April 18, 2022; Draft EIR Nov. 16, 2023; Final EIR Nov. 26, 2024; NODs Nov. 22 and Dec. 13, 2024. Project description: up to about 2,600 units and up to 4,915,000 gsf.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001995"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City Resolution No. 24-9398 (PD Rezoning, Option B) lists the 48.6-acre project site as APNs 104-04-150, 104-04-142, 104-04-143, 104-04-151, 104-04-112, 104-04-113, 104-04-065, 104-04-111 and 104-04-064; applicant Kylli, Inc. through its subsidiary Innovation Commons Owner, LLC. County parcel data shows all nine parcels, with situs addresses including 4995 Patrick Henry Dr, 3005 and 3055 Democracy Wy, 2945 Tasman Dr and 4850 Old Ironsides Dr.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002062",
        "SRC-002063"
      ]
    }
  ],
